{
 "title": "变量",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "**变量**是值的名字。在 Greengold 中用 `=` 来定义；编译器会根据值推断类型。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn main():",
    "    x = 42",
    "    name = \"Ahmet\"",
    "    x = 50",
    "    print(x, name)"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "50 Ahmet"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "变量默认可以修改。对永远不变的值，写 `fixed`；以后再尝试修改会产生编译错误。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn main():",
    "    fixed limit = 10",
    "    print(limit)"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "10"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "exercise",
   "id": "c01-l01-x1",
   "prompt": "让 `counter` 从 0 开始，用 `+= 1` 把它增加两次，然后输出结果。",
   "starter": [
    "fn main():",
    "    counter = 0",
    "    print(counter)"
   ],
   "solution": [
    "fn main():",
    "    counter = 0",
    "    counter += 1",
    "    counter += 1",
    "    print(counter)"
   ],
   "hint": "把 `counter += 1` 这一行写两遍。",
   "expected": [
    "2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
   "id": "c01-l01-q1",
   "q": "哪个关键字用来定义永远不变的变量？",
   "options": [
    "const",
    "fixed",
    "let"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "why": "在函数内部使用 `fixed`；`const` 用于文件级常量。"
  }
 ]
}
